{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Vertig8.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vertig8 is a <strong>third-person vertical shooter</strong> set inside a massive skyscraper where height itself becomes the battlefield. Each floor brings new risks, tighter spaces, and fresh opportunities to outplay your rivals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The first mode integrated into the game is <strong>Last Man Standing</strong>\u2014a high-stakes fight for survival where only one player or team reaches the top. More modes will follow, but this marks the starting point of Vertig8\u2019s ascent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark ambients, vertical progression, and floor-by-floor combat create a tense multiplayer experience unlike anything else. Flashlights cut through the shadows, and every decision\u2014whether to climb, hold, or fight\u2014can mean victory or elimination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vertig8 isn\u2019t just about shooting. It\u2019s about mastering vertical combat, adapting to unpredictable encounters, and proving you can survive the skyscraper.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2980760?t=1758499594","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2980760?t=1758499594","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2980760/d708dbb7637cb5dafb59dfe382e02018adb3c769/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758499594","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2980760/d708dbb7637cb5dafb59dfe382e02018adb3c769/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758499594","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Vertig8.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vertig8 is a <strong>third-person vertical shooter</strong> set inside a massive skyscraper where height itself becomes the battlefield. Each floor brings new risks, tighter spaces, and fresh opportunities to outplay your rivals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The first mode integrated into the game is <strong>Last Man Standing</strong>\u2014a high-stakes fight for survival where only one player or team reaches the top. More modes will follow, but this marks the starting point of Vertig8\u2019s ascent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark ambients, vertical progression, and floor-by-floor combat create a tense multiplayer experience unlike anything else. Flashlights cut through the shadows, and every decision\u2014whether to climb, hold, or fight\u2014can mean victory or elimination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vertig8 isn\u2019t just about shooting. It\u2019s about mastering vertical combat, adapting to unpredictable encounters, and proving you can survive the skyscraper.</p>","developers":["Pikzul"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Massively Multiplayer","id":"29"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2980760/b860e7f3252deee4c25198a652fe510d5146e6a7/header.jpg?t=1758499594","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2980760/706175/82693e4f9a530401bae05d18cea1981d2fd5f1fd/1750954939/dash_av1.mpd?t=1717990486","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2980760/706175/82693e4f9a530401bae05d18cea1981d2fd5f1fd/1750954939/dash_h264.mpd?t=1717990486","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2980760/706175/82693e4f9a530401bae05d18cea1981d2fd5f1fd/1750954939/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1717990486","id":257026503,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_tr